      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        469.01641845703125,
        527.2499389648438,
        483.4594421386719
      ],
      "text": "This recommendation was first put forward in 2010 and considered valid in the 2017 guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        482.1064147949219,
        527.421142578125,
        496.659423828125
      ],
      "text": "Annex 1 update (see summary of recommendations in  ). It is copied without modification into this",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        495.41632080078125,
        392.4347229003906,
        509.8593444824219
      ],
      "text": "consolidated document and appears exactly as in the 2010 guidelines.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        523.2335815429688,
        216.29168701171875,
        539.0856323242188
      ],
      "text": "Justification and evidence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        546.2935180664062,
        527.2363891601562,
        560.7365112304688
      ],
      "text": "The systematic review identified only one relevant study (with results published in 2012). A study",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        559.4935302734375,
        527.4299926757812,
        573.9365234375
      ],
      "text": "still under way (at moment of review) in Bangladesh of a 6-month rifampicin-containing regimen",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        572.6934814453125,
        527.1987915039062,
        587.136474609375
      ],
      "text": "randomized 3775 new smear-positive patients who remained positive at 2 months to either the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        584.6174926757812,
        524.4075927734375,
        600.3364868164062
      ],
      "text": "(24) 1-month extension arm (extension of the intensive phase by 1 month) or the no-extension arm  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        607.5975341796875,
        527.4487915039062,
        622.04052734375
      ],
      "text": "Preliminary results at 1 year of follow-up showed that patients in the 1-month extension arm had",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        620.7974853515625,
        527.1943969726562,
        635.240478515625
      ],
      "text": "a significantly lower relapse rate (relative risk 0.37, 95% confidence interval [CI]: 0.21, 0.66) than",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        633.9974365234375,
        527.44873046875,
        648.4404296875
      ],
      "text": "patients in the no-extension arm. A smaller decrease in failure in the 1-month extension arm was",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        647.1973876953125,
        527.4146728515625,
        661.640380859375
      ],
      "text": "not statistically significant. Given the preliminary nature of the results and the passive follow-up of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        660.3975219726562,
        467.0091552734375,
        674.8405151367188
      ],
      "text": "patients, the evidence from the Bangladesh study was graded with moderate certainty.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        682.1014404296875,
        527.5762329101562,
        696.54443359375
      ],
      "text": "In 1000 TB patients with a 7% risk of relapse, the Bangladesh study predicts that extending the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        695.3013916015625,
        527.4320678710938,
        709.744384765625
      ],
      "text": "treatment of 183 patients who are smear-positive at 2 months would avert 16 of the 70 expected",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        708.5014038085938,
        527.0517578125,
        722.9443969726562
      ],
      "text": "relapses. However, to achieve this 23% reduction in relapses, 158 patients per 1000 would be incorrectly",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        721.701416015625,
        459.5071716308594,
        736.1444091796875
      ],
      "text": "predicted to relapse; consequently their treatment would be extended unnecessarily.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        743.4052734375,
        527.5293579101562,
        757.8482666015625
      ],
      "text": "While extending rifampicin beyond 6 months reduces the risk of relapse, there is insufficient evidence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.990546226501465,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        756.6052856445312,
        527.45751953125,
        771.0482788085938
      ],
      "text": "to determine which patients are most likely to benefit. Historically, when the new patient regimen",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
